    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world of\u00a0<strong>Vanathis</strong>, a forsaken archipelago where war and time have buried the past. The Grand Cathedral stands as the last monument to the Three Goddesses, surrounded by ruins, silence, and something unseen stirring beneath. Lost kingdoms, forgotten truths\u2014only despair remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the strongest</strong>: Fight powerful bosses and defeat dangerous enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your build</strong>: Choose from many armors and weapons to match your style.<br><i>(The UI will be changed)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience retro graphics reimagined</strong>: Classic Game Art enhanced with modern effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Dark Fantasy</strong>: Explore a macabre, depressive island filled with haunting mysteries.<br> <br><br>Join over +100k followers and enter the world of Dark Island: Faded Memories. This RPG takes you back in time with retro and dark fantasy feel. Explore the mysterious and depressed island, uncover its secrets and enjoy the adventure.<br><br>Follow the game on TikTok and YouTube to watch its development daily.\u00a0<br><br><i>This page is under construction, new images and descriptions will be added soon!</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/54e9ec1bad46984eb72c1afacd045559.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world of\u00a0<strong>Vanathis</strong>, a forsaken archipelago where war and time have buried the past. The Grand Cathedral stands as the last monument to the Three Goddesses, surrounded by ruins, silence, and something unseen stirring beneath. Lost kingdoms, forgotten truths\u2014only despair remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/72bf6d4e05ca7834f232219f509190c6.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the strongest</strong>: Fight powerful bosses and defeat dangerous enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/18c2802263cd56193c27ad4209e80422.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your build</strong>: Choose from many armors and weapons to match your style.<br><i>(The UI will be changed)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/0a1ecf93f4de75a3f2b041a20180d519.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience retro graphics reimagined</strong>: Classic Game Art enhanced with modern effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.poster.avif?t=1753977808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.webm?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332120/extras/9e5cdbbfb62c4bf107843d212d57d177.mp4?t=1753977808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Dark Fantasy</strong>: Explore a macabre, depressive island filled with haunting mysteries.<br> <br><br>Join over +100k followers and enter the world of Dark Island: Faded Memories. This RPG takes you back in time with retro and dark fantasy feel. Explore the mysterious and depressed island, uncover its secrets and enjoy the adventure.<br><br>Follow the game on TikTok and YouTube to watch its development daily.\u00a0<br><br><i>This page is under construction, new images and descriptions will be added soon!</i></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Retro Dark Fantasy RPG crafted with a passion for old-school video games. Embark on an adventure to explore diverse locations, battle monsters and fallen soldiers, and uncover the lost mysteries of the island along with its beautiful landscapes.",
